: "You play as Clark Anderson, a university student living in room 305 who works part-time as a security guard for Liminal Legacy.\n\nOn your way to work, you realize that you're trapped on your own floor, with seemingly no way out. As you explore the building, familiar places become unrecognizable, and the world around you becomes increasingly strange.\n\nDiscover the building's history, and search for a way out.", "summary": "Unsound is a first-person psychological horror game. Explore unsettling environments, solve puzzles, and uncover a dark mystery. Things are not always as they seem, and the deeper you go, the stranger things become. Pay attention to your surroundings and piece together the clues.", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/unsound", "videos": [{"id": 200328, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "V-L4Ac64dRU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V-L4Ac64dRU", "title": "Unsound - Official Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/V-L4Ac64dRU/sddefault.jpg"}]}